{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2023-01-12 10:23:00', 'title': 'MISSOURI AMERICAN WATER TO INVEST OVER $425 MILLION TO UPGRADE WATER AND WASTEWATER SYSTEMS THIS YEAR', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--MISSOURI AMERICAN WATER IS CONTINUING TO PROACTIVELY INVEST IN ITS WATER AND WASTEWATER SYSTEMS STATEWIDE, WITH OVER $425 MILLION IN IMPROVEMENTS PLANNED IN 2023. PROJECTS INCLUDE THE REPLACEMENT OF AGING WATER AND WASTEWATER PIPES AND TREATMENT PLANT UPGRADES.'}